# Excel workbooks are binary. Git detects this on its own, but saying so here rules
# out a future line-ending or diff filter silently corrupting one.
*.xlsm binary
*.xlsx binary

# VBA modules are stored byte for byte, CRLF included, rather than normalised to LF.
# A client downloads export/vba/GMWO-Export.bas straight from GitHub and imports it
# into Excel, and the VBA editor is unreliable about importing a file with LF-only
# line endings. Excel writes these files as CRLF; keep them that way.
*.bas -text
